<section class="space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">How long we keep it</h2>
    <p class="text-content-muted leading-relaxed">
        Project, contract and payment records are kept for six years after the project's final
        account, because the law and our insurers require it. The audit trail of who did what in the
        portal is kept for the same period; the assistant's own activity log for two years. A sign-in
        session, an invitation link and a password reset link are removed thirty days after they expire;
        an access request nobody answered after ninety days; recognised text from a scanned document
        after six months. An enquiry that does not become a project — with its photographs and concept
        pictures — is kept while we are in touch and removed when you ask, or when we close the enquiry.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Your rights</h2>
    <p class="text-content-muted leading-relaxed">
        You can ask us for a copy of what we hold about you, to correct it, to delete it, to stop using
        it for a particular purpose, or to give it to you in a form you can take elsewhere. Where we rely
        on your consent you can withdraw it at any time; where we rely on our legitimate interests you can
        object, and we will stop unless we can show a compelling reason not to.
    </p>
    <p class="text-content-muted leading-relaxed">
        Some records we have to keep even when you ask us to delete them — the contract, the invoices,
        the CIS returns, the health and safety record. In those cases we remove everything that
        identifies you beyond what the record needs, and we tell you what stays and why.
    </p>
    <p class="text-content-muted leading-relaxed">
        To ask, email <a class="text-accent hover:text-accent-hover" href="mailto:@ContactAddress">@ContactAddress</a>.
        We answer within a month. If you are not satisfied with our answer you can complain to the
        Information Commissioner's Office at <a class="text-accent hover:text-accent-hover" href="https://ico.org.uk" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a>.
    </p>
</section>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public string ContactAddress { get; set; } = "";
}
